vision-1</small></span></button></div></section></div><div class="composer-state-row"><span class="composer-state" id="assistant-composer-status">单一会话 · 默认执行环境 · 上下文自动压缩</span><span aria-label="App Server 已连接" class="connection-indicator" data-state="connected" role="status" title="App Server 已连接"></span></div></form></div></div></section><section class="shell-view shell-page-view" data-od-id="shell-view-projects" data-shell-view="projects" hidden=""><div class="page-stack" data-filter-scope=""><header class="catalog-market-header function-market-header" data-od-id="projects-header-inline"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="项目视图筛选"><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter="current" data-filter-group="project-mode" type="button"><span>当前任务</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="gate" data-filter-group="project-mode" type="button"><span>Gate</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="handoff" data-filter-group="project-mode" type="button"><span>交付</span></button></div><div class="catalog-header-actions"><label class="catalog-search" aria-label="搜索项目任务"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input placeholder="搜索任务、Gate、MCP" type="search" value=""/></label><button class="button primary" type="button">发起任务</button></div></header><section class="catalog-source-bar" data-od-id="project-filters-inline"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="项目来源筛选"><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter="teamflow" data-filter-group="project-source" type="button"><span>小队队列</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="personal" data-filter-group="project-source" type="button"><span>个人关注</span></button></div><span class="catalog-context-note">Stage Gate：需求确认 · running 56%</span></section><section class="capability-catalog function-catalog" data-od-id="project-task-catalog"><article class="catalog-card project-card" data-card-filter="current gate teamflow" data-od-id="project-card-requirement-gate"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true">审</div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>Gate</span><strong>需求确认 Gate</strong></div><p>展示任务分解、角色分配、预估时长；批准后进入并行执行。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>小队队列</span><span>待批准</span><span>高优先级</span></div></div></article><article class="catalog-card project-card" data-card-filter="current agent teamflow" data-od-id="project-card-parallel-nodes"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true">并</div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>Workflow</span><strong>并行任务节点</strong></div><p>前端实现、测试生成、文档更新并行执行，输出进入共享 Context。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>小队队列</span><span>3/6</span><span>运行中</span></div></div><span class="status success">运行中</span></article><article class="catalog-card project-card" data-card-filter="current gate teamflow" data-od-id="project-card-github-auth"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true">GH</div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>MCP</span><strong>GitHub MCP 授权</strong></div><p>读取 Issue 前需要 Owner 确认；失败后进入重试 1/3。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>小队队列</span><span>待授权</span><span>Gate</span></div></div></article><article class="catalog-card project-card" data-card-filter="current handoff teamflow" data-od-id="project-card-audit-archive"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true">档</div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>Handoff</span><strong>产物与审计归档</strong></div><p>节点完成后保留文件、报告、权限使用和敏感访问记录。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>小队队列</span><span>交付中</span><span>180 天</span></div></div><span class="status">待完成</span></article><div class="filter-empty-state" data-filter-empty="" hidden="">没有匹配项</div></section><section class="workspace-grid"><section class="page-panel" data-od-id="project-execution-inline"><div class="panel-head"><h3>Workflow 执行队列</h3><span class="status warn">可中断</span></div><div class="compact-list" id="project-log" aria-live="polite"><article class="capability-row is-priority"><div><strong>需求确认 Gate</strong><p>展示任务分解、角色分配、预估时长；批准后进入并行执行。</p></div><span class="status">待完成</span></article><article class="capability-row"><div><strong>并行任务节点</strong><p>前端实现、测试生成、文档更新并行执行，输出进入共享 Context。</p></div><span class="status success">运行中</span></article><article class="capability-row"><div><strong>GitHub MCP 授权</strong><p>读取 Issue 前需要 Owner 确认；失败后进入重试 1/3。</p></div><span class="status">待完成</span></article><article class="capability-row"><div><strong>产物与审计归档</strong><p>节点完成后保留文件、报告、权限使用和敏感访问记录。</p></div><span class="status">待完成</span></article></div></section><aside class="side-rail" data-od-id="project-flow-inspector-inline"><section class="rail-panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>执行状态机</h3><span class="status">6 态</span></div><div class="step-list"><div class="step-row done"><span></span><strong>pending · 排队</strong></div><div class="step-row done"><span></span><strong>initialized · 已解析</strong></div><div class="step-row active"><span></span><strong>running · 并行执行</strong></div><div class="step-row active"><span></span><strong>waiting_approval · Gate</strong></div><div class="step-row"><span></span><strong>completed · 交付</strong></div><div class="step-row"><span></span><strong>failed/retrying · 恢复</strong></div></div></section><section class="rail-panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>节点类型</h3><span class="status">start/task/gate</span></div><div class="compact-list"><div class="capability-row"><div><strong>start -&gt; task</strong><p>接收需求后拆成可执行节点。</p></div><span class="status">核心</span></div><div class="capability-row"><div><strong>parallel -&gt; merge</strong><p>并行分发给多个角色，合并为共享上下文。</p></div><span class="status">并行</span></div><div class="capability-row"><div><strong>gate -&gt; end</strong><p>人类确认关键决策，再进入交付或回退。</p></div><span class="status warn">卡点</span></div></div></section><section class="rail-panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>最小上下文</h3><span class="status success">已锁定</span></div><p>只传 PRD 能力域、当前页面壳、审批策略，不把完整历史对话塞给 Agent。</p><p>正在读取当前账号的资源。</p></section></aside></section></div></section><section class="shell-view shell-page-view" data-filter-scope="" data-od-id="shell-view-agents" data-shell-view="agents" hidden=""><div class="page-stack" data-filter-scope=""><header class="catalog-market-header" data-od-id="agents-header-inline"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="能力分类筛选"><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="employee" data-filter-group="category" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg><span>智能体</span></button><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter="skill" data-filter-group="category" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg><span>技能</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="service" data-filter-group="category" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg><span>服务</span></button></div><div class="catalog-header-actions"><label class="catalog-search" aria-label="搜索能力"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input placeholder="搜索智能体、技能或服务" type="search" value=""/></label><button class="button compact" type="button">刷新资源</button><button class="button compact" type="button">创建技能</button><button class="button compact primary" type="button">创建服务</button></div></header><div class="catalog-location-filter" role="group" aria-label="运行位置筛选"><span>运行位置</span><button aria-pressed="true" class="catalog-location-filter-button active" type="button">全部</button><button aria-pressed="false" class="catalog-location-filter-button" type="button">本地</button><button aria-pressed="false" class="catalog-location-filter-button" type="button">云端</button><span class="catalog-location-summary">本地 17 · 云端 54</span></div><div class="catalog-category-states"><div class="catalog-category-state is-loading" data-resource-category="skills" role="status"><div><strong>正在更新技能，继续显示上次成功加载的 39 项。</strong></div></div></div><section class="capability-catalog" data-od-id="agent-capability-catalog" data-catalog-filter="skill"><article class