>26</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day" type="button" aria-label="8月27日周四，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>27</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day" type="button" aria-label="8月28日周五，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>28</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day" type="button" aria-label="8月29日周六，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>29</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day" type="button" aria-label="8月30日周日，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>30</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day" type="button" aria-label="8月31日周一，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>31</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day outside" type="button" aria-label="9月1日周二，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>1</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day outside" type="button" aria-label="9月2日周三，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>2</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day outside" type="button" aria-label="9月3日周四，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>3</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day outside" type="button" aria-label="9月4日周五，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>4</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day outside" type="button" aria-label="9月5日周六，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>5</span></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day outside" type="button" aria-label="9月6日周日，无日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>6</span></button></div><footer class="schedule-calendar-legend"><span><i></i> 有日程</span><span>选择日期查看并管理当天安排</span></footer></div><aside class="schedule-agenda-pane" aria-label="所选日期的日程"><header class="schedule-agenda-header"><div><span>今天</span><strong>8月3日周一</strong></div><span class="schedule-agenda-count">0 项</span></header><div class="schedule-agenda-list"></div><div class="schedule-agenda-empty"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-clock"><path d="M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M3 10h5"></path><path d="M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14"></path><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6"></circle></svg><strong>这一天还没有安排</strong><p>选择其他日期查看日程，或创建一个新的自动执行安排。</p><button class="button primary" type="button" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>新建日程</button></div></aside></section></div><div class="modal-backdrop" hidden="" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="schedule-create-title"><form class="arrangement-modal-card schedule-create-modal"><header class="arrangement-modal-header"><div><h2 id="schedule-create-title">新建个人日程</h2><p>CrewON 会按你的安排自动执行，并将结果发送给你。</p></div><button class="icon-action compact" type="button" aria-label="关闭"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></header><label class="form-field"><span>日程名称</span><input required="" value="每日项目进展摘要"/></label><label class="form-field"><span>要完成什么</span><textarea required="" rows="4">汇总项目进展、关键变化、阻塞和需要我确认的事项，并给出下一步建议。</textarea></label><fieldset class="schedule-frequency"><legend>执行频率</legend><button class="active" type="button">每天</button><button class="" type="button">每周</button><button class="" type="button">按间隔</button><button class="" type="button">单次</button></fieldset><div class="schedule-time-fields"><label class="form-field"><span>执行时间</span><input type="time" required="" value="18:00"/></label></div><section class="schedule-delivery"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-inbox"><polyline points="22 12 16 12 14 15 10 15 8 12 2 12"></polyline><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path></svg><div><strong>结果发送给：我（创建者）</strong><span>保存在个人日程中心和专属结果线程，可从执行记录随时查看。</span></div></section><footer class="arrangement-modal-actions"><button class="button" type="button">取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-clock"><path d="M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M3 10h5"></path><path d="M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14"></path><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6"></circle></svg>创建并启用</button></footer></form></div></section><section class="shell-view shell-page-view" data-filter-scope="" data-od-id="shell-view-team" data-shell-view="team" hidden=""><div class="page-stack" data-filter-scope=""><header class="catalog-market-header function-market-header" data-od-id="team-header-inline"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="团队视图筛选"><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter="office" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>办公室</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="workflow" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>协作流</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="experts" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>专家团</span></button></div><div class="catalog-header-actions"><label class="catalog-search" aria-label="搜索办公室"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input placeholder="搜索办公室、目标或成员" type="search" value=""/></label><button class="button" type="button">同步真实数据</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-team-action="office" disabled="">创建办公室</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-team-action="experts" disabled="" hidden="">创建专家团</button></div></header><section class="team-office-shell" data-card-filter="office" data-office-shell="" data-od-id="team-office-shell"><div class="office-card-grid" data-office-list="" aria-label="办公室卡片"><section aria-labelledby="_R_2jv_" class="team-office-empty" data-office-empty-state="unavailable"><header class="team-office-empty-head"><span class="team-office-empty-kicker">OFFICE RUNTIME</span><h3 id="_R_2jv_">办公室运行态正在恢复</h3><p>当前工作空间的办公室数据暂时无法读取，系统会自动重试；不会使用演示数据替代。</p></header><div aria-label="办公室能力" class="team-office-capability-grid"><article class="team-office-capability"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square-text"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path><path d="M13 8H7"></path><path d="M17 12H7"></path></svg></span><div><strong>群聊</strong><p>向组长或指定员工发送消息，持续保留同一条协作主线。</p></div></article><article class="team-office-capability"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks"><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="M13 6h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 18h8"></path></svg></span><div><strong>任务协作</strong><p>通过群聊 @ 组长或员工派发、跟进和确认任务，保持结果可追踪。</p></div></article><article class="team-office-capability"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brain-circuit"><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"></path><path d="M9 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3-4"></path><path d="M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5"></path><path d="M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396"></path><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516"></path><path d="M12 13h4"></path><path d="M12 18h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path><path d="M12 8h8"></path><path d="M16 8V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2"></path><circle cx="16" cy="13" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="3" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="21" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="8" r=".5"></circle></svg></span><div><strong>记忆与上下文</strong><p>沉淀办公室范围内的事实、偏好和决策，并控制可见边界。</p></div></article></div><footer class="team-office-empty-footer"><span class="team-office-connection-state" data-state="unavailable" role="status">等待自动重试</span></footer></section></div><section class="office-room-inline team-office-runtime-room" data-office-room="" hidden="" tabindex="-1"><div class="team-office-room-loading" role="status">正在连接办公室运行态…</div></section></section><section class="team-workflow-shell" data-card-filter="workflow" data-od-id="team-workflow-shell" data-workflow-shell="" hidden=""><section class="team-office-empty team-capability-live-empty"><span class="team-office-empty-kicker">CrewON Workflow</span><h2>正在读取协作流</h2><p>正在从当前工作空间读取 CrewON 协作流定义。</p><button class="button" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-cw" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-9-9c2.52 0 4.93 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path></svg>重新同步</button></section></section><section class="team-experts-shell" data-card-filter="experts" data-od-id="team-experts-shell" hidden=""><section class="team-office-empty team-capability-live-empty"><span class="team-office-empty-kicker">团长单聊 · 后台协作</span><h2>还没有专家团</h2><p>创建后由团长承接你的消息，探索与执行专家只在后台向团长汇报。</p></section><div class="team-capability-inline-status" role="status">正在读取专家团…</div></section><div id="team-log" class="sr-log" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section></section></section></section>"`;

exports[`CommandWorkspace > snapshots active, archived, and deleted Thread Workspace rails 1`] = `
{
  "active": "<aside class="command-thread-operations-rail" aria-label="工作空间操作"><section class="page-panel workspace-operations-panel" aria-labelledby="workspace-operations-title" data-workspace-operations="control" data-mutation-authority="desktop" data-locale="zh"><header class="panel-head"><div><h3 id="workspace-operations-title">工作空间操作</h3><p>当前线程 · 已选择工作空间</p></div><span class="status success">实时</span></header><div class="slim-controls"><span class="catalog-context-note">仅显示顶层安全条目</span><button class="button compact primary" type="button" data-workspace-action="create"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>读取顶层目录</button></div><div class="filter-empty-state" data-workspace-empty="true">当前线程还没有工作空间操作。</div><div class="sr-log" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-workspace-live-state="live">工作空间操作已同步。</div></section></aside>",
  "archived": "<aside class="command-thread-operations-rail" aria-label="工作空间操作"><section class="page-panel workspace-operations-panel" aria-labelledby="workspace-operations-title" data-workspace-operations="control" data-mutation-authority="desktop" data-locale="zh"><header class="panel-head"><div><h3 id="workspace-operations-title">工作空间操作</h3><p>当前线程 · 已选择工作空间</p></div><span class="status success">实时</span></header><div class="slim-controls"><span class="catalog-context-note">仅显示顶层安全条目</span><button class="button compact primary" type="button" data-workspace-action="create" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>读取顶层目录</button></div><div class="filter-empty-state" data-workspace-authority-notice="desktop" role="status">当前线程不是活动状态，不能发起新的工作空间操作。</div><div class="filter-empty-state" data-workspace-empty="true">当前线程还没有工作空间操作。</div><div class="sr-log" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-workspace-live-state="live">工作空间操作已同步。</div></section></aside>",
